摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent-agnostic workflow skill for maintaining Obsidian knowledge bases","id":"gh:1291137394","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"Cobsidian","slug":"Totoro-qaq/Cobsidian","topics":["agent-skill","ai-agent","codex","dsh-plugin","knowledge-base","markdown","obsidian"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent-agnostic workflow skill for maintaining Obsidian knowledge bases"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Cobsidian"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Turn AI conversations into linked Obsidian knowledge, safely."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Cobsidian is an agent-agnostic workflow skill for maintaining an Obsidian or Markdown vault. It sear"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ches before creating, previews the proposed change, asks for one plain-language confirmation, writes"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" atomically, and validates the result. Integrity hashes stay in the execution layer; users do not co"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"py confirmation codes."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"It is not a hosted service or an Obsidian plugin. Your coding agent runs the workflow against a loca"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"l folder of Markdown files."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Quick Start · How It Works · Install · DeepSeek Harness · MCP Server · Compatibility · Latest Releas"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"uick Start · How It Works · Install · DeepSeek Harness · MCP Server · Compatibility · Latest Release"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Use the agent you already know: Claude Code · Codex CLI · GitHub Copilot CLI · Kimi Code · OpenCode "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"already know: Claude Code · Codex CLI · GitHub Copilot CLI · Kimi Code · OpenCode · Pi · Antigravity"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Synthetic demo vault. No private notes, paths, or credentials."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Run a read-only dry run against the bundled demo vault:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then point your agent at `skills/cobsidian/SKILL.md`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What Cobsidian Does"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Stage | What Cobsidian makes visible |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Read | Resolves the vault and builds identities from filenames, H1s, titles, and aliases. |\n| Deci"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"de | Reports `create | append | blocked` separately from note shape. |\n| Review | Returns duplicate "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"risk, backlink suggestions, and an exact patch plan. |\n| Approve | Asks `Apply this reviewed change?"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"`; the selected plan ID stays internal. |\n| Write | Verifies the internal plan and file hashes, writ"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"es atomically, validates, and keeps rollback available. |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The result is durable Markdown with useful `[[wiki links]]`, not a second copy of a note that alread"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"t is durable Markdown with useful `[[wiki links]]`, not a second copy of a note that already exists."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Before / After"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Before | After |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Useful answers disappear in chat history | Reusable notes stay in the vault |\n| Repeated prompts c"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"reate near-duplicates | Existing identities are checked first |\n| Links are guessed while writing | "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"Backlinks come from actual vault notes |\n| Agent edits are hard to audit | A reviewed, integrity-bou"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"nd plan precedes every write |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The confirmation is intentionally human: **Apply this reviewed change?** On approval, the host passe"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s the exact plan ID associated with that preview to the deterministic writer. The ID, target fingerp"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"rint, and before/after SHA-256 values remain internal integrity checks."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- You never need to read, copy, or type a hash.\n- Approval applies only to the single change just di"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"splayed.\n- If the target note or proposed content changes, the old approval becomes invalid and Cobs"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"idian asks again.\n- If several previews are pending, Cobsidian identifies them by target and summary"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" instead of guessing which hash you meant."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Dry-run Preview"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Dry run is the default safe path. It reports the decision and leaves `writes` empty."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Not Just Markdown Generation"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Ordinary Markdown generation | Cobsidian |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Produces a standalone file | Maintains a linked knowledge system |\n| Ignores existing notes | Scan"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"s the vault before writing |\n| Mixes action and document shape | Separates machine action from note "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"plan |\n| Writes immediately | Plans, confirms, writes, validates, and can roll back |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Knowledge Read / 整理判读"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Before writing, Cobsidian computes a Knowledge Read: mode, depth, granularity, evidence, and display"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" choice. `auto | always | off` controls conversational presentation only. With `off`, `display_style"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"` is hidden while the complete JSON remains available in dry-run output."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Capability-based degradation keeps the result honest. A local host can become ready after checks, MC"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"P remains read-only, and a chat-only host returns a draft or requests a usable path instead of claim"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ing work it could not perform. Detailed rules live in the mode and host references and the shared pr"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" not perform. Detailed rules live in the mode and host references and the shared preflight contract."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Compact Knowledge Read"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Expanded Knowledge Read"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Obsidian Vault Workflow"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Requirements: Git, Python 3.10+, a Markdown vault, and a coding agent that can read local instructio"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"ns and run commands."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Preview the destinations, then install the skill for supported CLIs:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Or copy the shared skill manually:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"See INSTALL.md for Windows, project-scoped, symlink, update, and uninstall instructions. See Integra"},{"id":"p48s2","text":"tions for host discovery paths."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness Cordis Bundle"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Cobsidian remains an Agent Skill. The optional DSH Cordis Bundle packages that same canonical skill "},{"id":"p50s2","text":"and Python backend as a native DeepSeek Harness extension, adding typed tools and one-shot approval "},{"id":"p50s3","text":"without changing the existing Skill, CLI, or MCP paths."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"The native workflow exposes scan, dry-run, prepare, apply, and rollback as separate tools. DSH prese"},{"id":"p52s2","text":"nts a one-shot approval while carrying the exact plan/transaction ID in the background; users do not"},{"id":"p52s3","text":" paste hashes. Private note material is passed through permission-restricted temporary files rather "},{"id":"p52s4","text":"than process arguments; the bundle stores plans under `~/.dsh/cobsidian` by default and does not sto"},{"id":"p52s5","text":"re API keys or tokens."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"The bundle currently targets the DSH `0.1.0-rc.6` API family because DeepSeek Harness is still a dev"},{"id":"p53s2","text":"eloper preview. See the bundle guide for configuration, use, and verification."},{"id":"p54s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"- Deterministic title and alias identity matching, including prefix-free core titles.\n- CJK bigrams "},{"id":"p55s2","text":"and trigrams for related-phrase matching.\n- Missing wiki-link and similar-title validation.\n- Pagina"},{"id":"p55s3","text":"ted local MCP tools for inspection and dry-run planning.\n- Integrity-hashed patches with human confi"},{"id":"p55s4","text":"rmation, internal exact-plan binding, atomic writes, and rollback.\n- Public quality evaluation for d"},{"id":"p55s5","text":"uplicate, backlink, append-target, and mode accuracy."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
